  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "事務所内を歩き回ったりして、\r\n何かあったのか、果穂？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この前、ジャングルの奥地を大探検！　って番組に\r\n出てた冒険家の人がスッゴいカッコよかったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、あたしもあんなふうに\r\n冒険がしてみたいですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん、冒険か……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "そういう仕事を\r\n探すのもいいか",
    "nextLabel": "1009001001011"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂はそういうのが\r\n得意そうだな",
    "nextLabel": "1009001001012"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "冒険は危険なことが\r\nいっぱいだぞ",
    "nextLabel": "1009001001013"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010030,
    "label": "1009001001011",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わーい！　ありがとうございます！\r\nえへへ、今から楽しみです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お仕事が来たら、スッゴい冒険しちゃいますね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010050,
    "label": "1009001001012",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、そう見えますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "大変なこともあるかもですけど、\r\nあたしも、困難を乗り越えてみたいですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010070,
    "label": "1009001001013",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "困難を乗り越えてこそ、たっせーかんがあるって、\r\n冒険家の人が言ってました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001010080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんがそう言うなら、\r\nあたしにはまだ早いのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100101/1009001001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
